  profileId: motivation.profile.combat.mid
  profileLabel: Combat Mid Motivation
  survivalNeed: This area pressures awareness, spacing, and escape options.
  survivalNeedWeight: 1.25
  resourceNeed: Loot matters less than learning how danger behaves in this water.
  resourceNeedWeight: 0.65
  engineeringNeed: Tools, control options, and support gear can change how threatening
    the space feels.
  engineeringNeedWeight: 1.05
  curiosityPull: Threat behavior and pressure pockets should still provoke observation,
    not only avoidance.
  curiosityPullWeight: 1
  storyPull: Danger zones can hint at why the ecosystem behaves differently here.
  storyPullWeight: 0.8
  rareValuePull: Rare value exists, but it should feel stolen from danger, not handed
    out.
  rareValuePullWeight: 1
  optionalityRule: These pulls are invitations, not requirements; the player decides
    which one matters today.
  returnRule: The area should stay worth revisiting later with a different goal,
    toolset, or tolerance for risk.
  ownershipRule: The player should feel they built their own reasons to come back
    here.
